Subject: [PATCH] feat(resource-packs): apply dependencies and selected
 subpacks

Resolve pack order from manifest dependencies while preserving server precedence for unrelated packs. Overlay the server-selected subpack before conversion and key the converted cache by effective content so variants cannot share a stale Java pack.
